1: /**
2:  * Cinejoy webOS - Deterministic 2D Spatial Remote Navigation & Focus Memory Engine
3:  * Standard: 10-Foot Television UX, webOS 8.5.0 (Chromium ~108+)
4:  * Target Device: LG 32LR686BPSA (1920x1080 Full HD Canvas)
5:  * 
6:  * Features:
7:  * - 2D Directional Spatial Navigation (edge-to-edge primary, orthogonal penalty, overlap bonus)
8:  * - Adaptive Two-Pass Directional Cones (60 deg strict, 85 deg fallback)
9:  * - webOS Remote Keycodes (38, 40, 37, 39, 13, 461/27, Media, Color keys)
10:  * - Key Repeat Throttling (60ms threshold, rapid burst detection)
11:  * - TV-Safe Two-Tier Auto-Scrolling (96px horizontal, 54px vertical, 104px header clearance)
12:  * - Stateful Per-View Focus Memory (6-step resolution cascade)
13:  * - Modal & Virtual Keyboard Focus Trapping (trap / untrap)
14:  */
