## 7. Conclusion

The CineJoy webOS spatial remote navigation engine exhibits high architectural maturity, successfully managing 2D distance calculations, two-tier auto-scrolling, and basic modal trapping. 

By adopting the five hardening recommendations detailed above—specifically **stack-based modal trapping**, **trapped self-healing focus recovery**, and **automatic search keyboard re-entry trapping**—the implementation will achieve absolute mathematical determinism and zero focus escape under aggressive 100-burst remote hammering on physical LG webOS televisions.
